globalAssignFunction.description:
DIV{HEADER1{globalAssignFunction,  -- the standard method for the global assignment hook}, DIV{HEADER2{Description}, TT{globalAssignFunction},  -- the standard function that can be used as a method for , TO{Macaulay2Doc :: GlobalAssignHook},  so that certain types of things, when assigned to a global variable, will acquire the name of the global variable as their name.  The companion function , TO{Macaulay2Doc :: globalReleaseFunction},  is used to release the name when the global variable gets reassigned., PARA{}, Another thing done by this function is to apply , TO{Macaulay2Doc :: use},  to the thing. This is used for polynomial rings to assign values to the symbols representing the variables (indeterminates) in the ring., PARA{}, TABLE{class => examples, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i1 : X = new Type of MutableHashTable

o1 = X

o1 : Type, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i2 : x = new X

o2 = X{}

o2 : X, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i3 : X.GlobalAssignHook = globalAssignFunction

o3 = globalAssignFunction

o3 : FunctionClosure, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i4 : X.GlobalReleaseHook = globalReleaseFunction

o4 = globalReleaseFunction

o4 : FunctionClosure, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i5 : x' = new X

o5 = x'

o5 : X, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i6 : t = {x,x'}

o6 = {X{}, x'}

o6 : List, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i7 : x = x' = 44

o7 = 44, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i8 : t

o8 = {X{}, X{}}

o8 : List, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i9 : code globalAssignFunction

o9 = /usr/share/Macaulay2/Core/startup.m2.in:193
     :28-197:11: --source code:
          globalAssignFunction = (X,x) -> (
               if not instance(X,Symbol) then error("globalAssignFunction: expected a symbol: ", toString X);
               if not hasAttribute(x,ReverseDictionary) then setAttribute(x,ReverseDictionary,X);
               use x;
               );, class => language-macaulay2}}}}}}, DIV{HEADER2{See also}, UL{LI{TOH{Macaulay2Doc :: symbol}}, LI{TOH{Macaulay2Doc :: SelfInitializingType}}}}, DIV{DIV{class => waystouse, HEADER2{For the programmer}, PARA{The object , TO{Macaulay2Doc :: globalAssignFunction},  is , SPAN{a , TO2{Macaulay2Doc :: FunctionClosure, function closure}}, .}}, HR{}, DIV{class => waystouse, PARA{The source of this document is in , TT{Macaulay2Doc/ov_repl.m2:225:0}, .}}}}

