o4 : List, class => language-macaulay2}}}}}, DIV{HEADER2{Strategy => EisenbudHunekeVasconcelos}, PARA{TEX{See , ITALIC{Direct methods for primary decomposition},  by Eisenbud, Huneke, and Vasconcelos, Invent. Math. 110, 207-235 (1992).}}}, TABLE{class => examples, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i5 : primaryDecomposition(I, Strategy => EisenbudHunekeVasconcelos)

