o5 : List, class => language-macaulay2}}}}}, DIV{HEADER2{Strategy => ShimoyamaYokoyama}, PARA{TEX{This strategy is the default for non-monomial ideals. See , ITALIC{Localization and Primary Decomposition of Polynomial ideals},  by Shimoyama and Yokoyama, J. Symb. Comp. 22, 247-277 (1996).}}}, TABLE{class => examples, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i6 : primaryDecomposition(I, Strategy => ShimoyamaYokoyama)

