R2{Citation}, PARA{If you have used , this package,  in your research, please cite it as follows:}, TABLE{class => examples, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{class => language-bib, @misc{MinimalPrimesSource,
  title = {{MinimalPrimes: minimal primes and radical routines for ideals. Version~0.10}},
  author = {Frank Moore and Mike Stillman and Franziska Hinkelmann and Justin Chen and Mahrud Sayrafi},
