o3 = 1, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i4 : peek T

o4 = MutableHashTable{b => 2}
                      c => 3, class => language-macaulay2}}}}}, DIV{PARA{TEX{If , TT{T},  is not a mutable hash table, an error is thrown. One way to remove an entry from an immutable hash table is with the function }, TO{Macaulay2Doc :: applyPairs}, TEX{:}}}, TABLE{class => examples, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i5 : T = new HashTable from {a => 1, b => 2, c => 3}

